METEOR
(C) 1995 UK Nick Stansfield

This is a game for the Psion series 3a.

You should have the following files:-

Meteor.cde
Meteor.ep1
Meteor.ep2
Meteor.ep3
Meteor.fnl
Meteor.lgo
Meteor.lvl
Meteor.mnu
Meteor.tp5
Meteor.wv1
Meteor.wv2
Meteor.xta
Meteor1.opa

Sorry there's so many :) 

Meteor is three games in one.

1)	Meteor storm - The meteor avoiding game
2)	Land - A shoot 'em up 
3)	Free relatives - A game where you direct a car around many individual levels.

HOW TO INSTALL

1)	Create a directory called "\meteor\" on any psion disk.
2)	Put all the "meteor.*" files in the directory.  These files must all be put on the same  disk.
3)	Put the "meteor1.opa" file into your "\app\" directory.
4)	On the system screen choose install from the apps menu and select "Meteor1.opa".

REASONS TO REGISTER

Meteor is not free, it's a SHAREWARE application.  You are granted a 21 day licence to use the product free of charge.  

If after the 21 day trial you decide the product has been of value to you and you wish to continue using it, then you MUST register.

What you get when you register: 
+	Peace of mind
+	No shareware screens
+	The ability to use other levels in "Free relatives"
+	Electricity, switches and invisible walls in "Free relatives". *
+	10 extra levels for "Free relatives" *
+	Level editor for "Free relatives", make and edit your own levels, swap with friends, upload and download them *

(* if you have access to an E-mail address only)

